      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "also, if different foundries is possible, would it be possible for us to potentially do an ihp + gf tapeout using ihp's high speed rf devices and gf on other parts? (don't see any economic benefits here cz our scale is small but would be a cool experiment)",
